Data for supplementary figures S5A-S5C were sourced from GSE215865 (cohort study of early COVID cases from Mount Sinai hospital system). Presence of viral reads were assessed via CZID (see Methods). Data and metadata used are not provided here, as you must create an account and access the data through the original manuscript’s Synapse project (Synapse ID: syn35876735). Data output used from CZID will be made upon reasonable request and proof that the user has registered and obtained access to the original project.
